      "category": "Standards",
      "level": "Warning",
      "heading": "The page redirects with a meta refresh.",
      "description": "The page uses <meta http-equiv=\"refresh\">. It breaks the back button, is slower than a server redirect, and search engines may not treat it as a permanent move.",
